{"id":"n55289-1-21","stage":1,"title":"교육 · 教育","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55289-1-21-1","ko":"우리 집 애가 공부에 관심이 없어서 큰일이에요.","zh":"我们家孩子对学习没兴趣，真是麻烦大了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"애가","meaning":"孩子","explanation":"애：孩子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"애","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73967","senseId":"2","lemma":"애","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"공부에","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부：学习，读书；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"공부","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36672","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"관심이","meaning":"关注，关心，兴趣","explanation":"관심：关注，关心，兴趣；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"관심","audio":"/audio/07b3c15a29688a55c61b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60096","senseId":"1","lemma":"관심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없어서","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"큰일이에요.","meaning":"大事","explanation":"큰일：大事；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"큰일","audio":"/audio/dbfb08997ec518d3dc88.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72174","senseId":"2","lemma":"큰일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"a9fee06ad11f5bbd","term":"애","zh":"孩子","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3","entryId":"73967","definition":"(谦词)自己的小孩。","pronunciation":["애ː"]},{"id":"c9b4aed6d54a8847","term":"공부","zh":"学习，读书","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3","entryId":"36672","definition":"通过学习学问或技术而获得知识。","pronunciation":["공부"]},{"id":"07b3c15a29688a55","term":"관심","zh":"关注，关心，兴趣","audio":"/audio/07b3c15a29688a55c61b.mp3","entryId":"60096","definition":"被某种东西吸引的情感和想法。","pronunciation":["관심"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不具有某物，或不具备资格、能力。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"dbfb08997ec518d3","term":"큰일","zh":"大事","audio":"/audio/dbfb08997ec518d3dc88.mp3","entryId":"72174","definition":"无法挽回的大事故或不好的事情。","pronunciation":["크닐"]}],"audio":"/audio/bf62f13de00162ebbc21.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n55289-1-21-2","ko":"아이들 교육 때문에 걱정이 많으시군요.","zh":"为了孩子们的教育，您一定很操心吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아이들","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"교육","meaning":"教育，培训","explanation":"교육：教育，培训","readings":[{"term":"교육","audio":"/audio/4da9a75910ede3adef01.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55289","senseId":"1","lemma":"교육","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때문에","meaning":"因为，由于","explanation":"때문：因为，由于；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"때문","audio":"/audio/e7ce9cf0ec012e05cb2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64555","senseId":"1","lemma":"때문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걱정이","meaning":"担心，忧虑，担忧","explanation":"걱정：担心，忧虑，担忧；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"걱정","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17232","senseId":"1","lemma":"걱정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많으시군요.","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；으시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"4da9a75910ede3ad","term":"교육","zh":"教育，培训","audio":"/audio/4da9a75910ede3adef01.mp3","entryId":"55289","definition":"为了培养个人能力，教授知识、教养和技术等。","pronunciation":["교ː육"]},{"id":"e7ce9cf0ec012e05","term":"때문","zh":"因为，由于","audio":"/audio/e7ce9cf0ec012e05cb2b.mp3","entryId":"64555","definition":"表示原因或理由。","pronunciation":["때문"]},{"id":"7582493f75565a84","term":"걱정","zh":"担心，忧虑，担忧","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3","entryId":"17232","definition":"害怕发生不好的事情而感到不安。","pronunciation":["걱쩡"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/50d7f899193a0664dbcf.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.693,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=55289","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":47,"sequenceScore":2.1174,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["为了孩子们的教育，您一定很操心吧。","奶奶，最近照顾孙子一定很开心吧？","我们家孩子对学习没兴趣，真是麻烦大了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["为了孩子们的教育，您一定很操心吧。","我们家孩子对学习没兴趣，真是麻烦大了。","奶奶，最近照顾孙子一定很开心吧？"],"answer":0}]}
